# Using Computed Properties for Validation

For each field, create a computed property that returns an error message or `null` if valid. Then conditionally display it.

```javascript
computed: {
  emailError() {
    if (!this.email) return 'Email is required';
    if (!this.email.includes('@')) return 'Please enter a valid email';
    return '';
  },
  isFormValid() {
    return !this.emailError && !this.passwordError;
  }
}
```

Then disable submit button: `<button :disabled="!isFormValid">Submit</button>`
